title: patch
---

How- 
Where did you find this?
I didn't even know Cobra had cool patches like this.
	->I found it on a jacket
		Oh really?
		I wish you had shown me.
		Who knows what other patches it might have had.
		Maybe it was that girl's jacket…
		Ugh nevermind.
			->The band gave it to me themself
				REALLY? COBRA WAS-?
				Wait.
				Ugh dude shut up, not funny.
				They stopped making music years ago.
				Me and my old band covered so many of their songs.
				Damnit, that would have been a cool thing to tell that girl…
				Ugh nevermind.

===





title: photo
---
Who…are these people? Where did you even find this?
	->I think it’s the Dragon Lady’s Family
		Dude why did you take a family photo?
		Imagine if a random kid took one of our family photos
		Well maybe we are not the best example
		It’s not like we have that many of those anyways
		But still, don’t take other people’s photos man.
			->I don’t know
				Well I hope no one is gonna miss this, it looks old.
				Eh they have probably others
				Maybe I should have brought one with us…
				Ugh no that’s waaay too cheesy for me.
				It’s not like we even have that many anyways.


===





title: plant
---
Brother: Woah you got one of the agave pups? 
Bother: Nice find dude 
Brother: I didn’t see any that were small enough to take.
Brother: I’ll have to pot it up when we get to Uni.

->A puppy? I thought this was a plant.
	No, not like an actual puppy dude.
	It’s like a baby plant.
	They're called that because they grow near their big mother plant.
	At least that's what my book told me.
		->I thought the car plant could use a friend.
			I guess so…
			Succulents and pothos don’t really go together.
			Pothos like more tropical weather
			And succulents like…
			well, the dessert.
			At least that's what my book told me.

